## 9. 权限规范

眼镜应用的权限处理与普通 Android 应用相同。典型需要处理的权限：

| 权限 | 用途 |
|---|---|
| `Manifest.permission.CAMERA` | 相机预览 |
| `Manifest.permission.RECORD_AUDIO` | 语音识别 |
| `Manifest.permission.ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION` | GPS 定位 |
| `Manifest.permission.BLUETOOTH` / `BLUETOOTH_CONNECT` | BLE 通信 |

权限检查和请求流程：

```kotlin
if (ContextCompat.checkSelfPermission(this, Manifest.permission.CAMERA)
    != PackageManager.PERMISSION_GRANTED
) {
    ActivityCompat.requestPermissions(this, arrayOf(Manifest.permission.CAMERA), REQUEST_CODE)
} else {
    startCameraActivity()
}

override fun onRequestPermissionsResult(requestCode: Int, ...) {
    super.onRequestPermissionsResult(requestCode, permissions, grantResults)
    if (requestCode == REQUEST_CODE && grantResults.isNotEmpty()
        && grantResults[0] == PackageManager.PERMISSION_GRANTED
    ) {
        startCameraActivity()
    }
}
```

