## 16. BLE 连接与 GPS 推流

### BLE 连接状态监听

使用 `MobileState.isMobileConnected()` 监听手机连接状态。

```kotlin
class APIActivity : BaseMirrorActivity<LayoutApiBinding>() {

    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {
        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)
        collectBleStatus()
    }

    private fun collectBleStatus() {
        MobileState.isMobileConnected()
            .onEach { isConnected ->
                FLogger.d("Mobile connected: $isConnected")
                mBindingPair.updateView {
                    tvBleStatus.text = if (isConnected) "已连接" else "未连接"
                }
            }
            .launchIn(lifecycleScope)
    }
}
```

### GPS 推流（需要 IPC SDK）

获取手机 GPS 数据需要集成 IPC SDK，具体实现参考 IPC SDK Sample。

```kotlin
// IPC SDK GPS 数据回调
private val gpsResponse = OnResponseListener { response ->
    response?.getData()?.let { data ->
        val json = JSONObject(data)
        val latitude = json.getDouble("mLatitude")
        val longitude = json.getDouble("mLongitude")
        val altitude = json.getDouble("mAltitude")

        runOnUiThread {
            mBindingPair.updateView {
                tvLocation.text = "$latitude, $longitude"
            }
        }
    }
}
```

**注意：`onResponse` 回调在异步线程，必须切换到主线程更新 UI。**

