## 17. 视频合目（SurfaceView / MirroringView）

### MirroringView 组件

对于视频播放等 SurfaceView 场景，使用 `MirroringView` 实现合目镜像。

```kotlin
class VideoPlayActivity : BaseMirrorActivity<LayoutVideoBinding>() {

    private var mPlayer: MediaPlayer? = null

    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {
        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)
        initPlayer()
    }

    private fun initPlayer() {
        binding.textureView.let { textureView ->
            // 设置 SurfaceTexture
            mPlayer = MediaPlayer().apply {
                setDataSource(context, Uri.parse("android.resource://$packageName/${R.raw.video}"))
                setSurface(Surface(textureView.surfaceTexture))
                prepare()
                start()
            }

            // 设置镜像
            binding.mirrorView.setSource(textureView)
            binding.mirrorView.startMirroring()
        }
    }

    override fun onDestroy() {
        super.onDestroy()
        binding.mirrorView.stopMirroring()  // 必须停止镜像
        mPlayer?.release()
        mPlayer = null
    }
}
```

### 布局结构要求

```
左眼布局：SurfaceView (textureView)
右眼布局：MirroringView (mirrorView)

SurfaceView 和 MirroringView 必须分属不同屏幕
```

