## 18. 跟手效果与滑动追踪器

### 三种滑动追踪器

| 追踪器 | 场景 | 特点 |
|--------|------|------|
| `RecyclerViewSlidingTracker` | 固定焦点位 + 列表滚动 | 焦点固定，列表滚动 |
| `RecyclerViewFocusTracker` | 移动焦点位 + 列表 | 滑动一定距离切换焦点 |
| `FixPosFocusTracker` | 移动焦点位 + 固定位置视图 | 自定义滑动阈值 |

### FixPosFocusTracker 参数详解

```kotlin
class FixPosFocusTracker(
    val focusHolder: FocusHolder,
    private val continuous: Boolean = false,    // 连续滑动模式
    private val isVertical: Boolean = true,     // 垂直滑动
    private val ignoreDelta: Int = IGNORE_DELTA // 焦点切换阈值(50dp)
)
```

| 参数 | 默认值 | 说明 |
|------|--------|------|
| `loop` | false | 焦点循环切换 |
| `continuous` | false | 单次滑动模式 |
| `isVertical` | true | 只响应垂直滑动 |
| `ignoreDelta` | 50dp | 滑动超过此距离才切换焦点 |

### 模式组合表

| 模式 | FocusHolder.loop | continuous | isVertical | ignoreDelta |
|------|------------------|------------|------------|-------------|
| 连续滑动 | 受影响 | true | 不受影响 | 受影响 |
| 单次滑动 | 受影响 | false | 受影响 | 受影响 |

### RecyclerView 跟手效果示例

```kotlin
class FixedFocusPosRVActivity : BaseMirrorActivity<LayoutRecyclerBinding>() {

    private lateinit var recyclerViewSlidingTracker: RecyclerViewSlidingTracker

    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {
        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)
        initRecyclerView()
        initEvent()
    }

    private fun initRecyclerView() {
        recyclerViewSlidingTracker = RecyclerViewSlidingTracker(
            ViewPair(mBindingPair.left.recyclerView, mBindingPair.right.recyclerView)
        )

        mBindingPair.updateView {
            recyclerView.layoutManager = LinearLayoutManager(context)
            recyclerView.adapter = MyAdapter(isLeft)
            recyclerView.itemAnimator = null  // 必须禁用
        }

        recyclerViewSlidingTracker.focusObj.hasFocus = true
    }

    private fun initEvent() {
        // 监听原始事件，修改坐标实现跟手
        recyclerViewSlidingTracker.observeOriginMotionEventStream(motionEventDispatcher) { event ->
            MotionEvent.obtain(
                event.downTime, event.eventTime, event.action,
                320f,  // 修改后的 X 坐标（列表中心）
                event.y, event.metaState
            )
        }

        lifecycleScope.launchWhenResumed {
            templeActionViewModel.state.collect { action ->
                if (!recyclerViewSlidingTracker.focusObj.hasFocus || action.consumed) return@collect
                recyclerViewSlidingTracker.handleActionEvent(action) { handledAction ->
                    when (handledAction) {
                        is TempleAction.DoubleClick -> finish()
                        is TempleAction.Click -> {
                            if (!handledAction.consumed) {
                                FToast.show("Selected item")
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```

